# Not uploaded to the Cloudflare Worker (same syntax as .gitignore).
# CNAME and .nojekyll are GitHub Pages control files; they stay in the repo
# until Pages is switched off after the cutover (marketplace/RUNBOOK.md §1c),
# because removing CNAME from the published branch drops the custom domain
# from the Pages site while it is still live.
CNAME
.nojekyll
